 when I was looking for information and  so I did so that became  the first video which I released on  knife I put it up on my personal channel  called feeling poem which is my name and  then just a few months later I made  another video on even Hal dune and both  of these videos were very successful a  lot of people seem to appreciate them a  lot and so this kind of because accede  to the idea that maybe I should make  channel or start making more videos  dedicated to this kind of thing at the  time I was a master student and the  study of religions and and was pretty  knowledgeable at least in my particular  field and so I thought maybe I should  make a channel where I shared this  knowledge because I thought were felt at  the time that YouTube was lacking in  good trustworthy academic content  regarding religion and related subjects  and so I created the channel let's talk  religion specifically dedicated to this  to filling that gap that I felt was on  YouTube of course since then there's  been a lot of other channels as well  that are really great but we all have  our own niches and our subjects that we  are specialized in but in case that's  that's how how I create this channel  that's the reason why I started making  these videos question number two what  has been your favorite subject of  research today that's a very really good  question very difficult question to  answer because I'm the kind of person  because I'm the kind of person who group  I'm interested in everything and  everything I hear about everything I  read I'm a very curious person and so  it's hard to just choose one subject as  I've said in some videos I have  specialized particularly in Sufism and  Islam and so obviously I am very  interested in those subjects and I think  that's a very interesting subject to  study but in particular probably because  I'm also a musician I have been very  interested in music and how music  relates to religion in different ways  for example Sufism of course 